# A generic call inside a fields() loop over a struct of 130 tables, each block with two locals
# (the loop's alias and an inner loop's binding), as example 121's inspector has over UiWorld: the
# specialization discovery pass kept every block's locals in 256 slots, so from the 127th block on
# a call read an earlier block's `table` and its own specialization was found only while the body
# was emitted. An instance registered while the C is written is now an internal error.
